===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|obsolete|nautical|lang=en}} A small [[galley]] or [[cookhouse]] on the [[deck]] of a small [[vessel]].
# {{context|US|rail transport|lang=en}} The last [[car]] on a [[freight]] [[train]], having [[cooking]] and [[sleeping]] [[facilities]] for the [[crew]]; a [[guard]]’s [[van]].
# {{context|slang|baby-talk|or|euphemistic|lang=en}} [[buttocks]]

